  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cormyrian_Robes\">Cormyrian Robes</span></h2>\n<table style=\"clear: right; border: 1px solid #FFD700; padding: 4px; width: 100%; --bg-color-1:#DDBB00;--bg-color-1-dark:#635400;--bg-color-2:#FFFACD;--bg-color-2-dark:#433E14;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\" width=\"15%\">Armor Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\" width=\"42.5%\">Clothing\n</td>\n<th class=\"bg-color-2\" rowspan=\"15\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" width=\"42.5%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Cormyrian_Robes_shown.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Cormyrian_Robes_shown.jpg/420px-Cormyrian_Robes_shown.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"273\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Cormyrian_Robes_shown.jpg/630px-Cormyrian_Robes_shown.jpg 1.5x, https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Cormyrian_Robes_shown.jpg/840px-Cormyrian_Robes_shown.jpg 2x\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Feat Requirement\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">None\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Race Absolutely Excluded\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><a href=\"/page/Warforged\" title=\"Warforged\">Warforged</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #F0DC82;\">Minimum Level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #FFFACD;\">16\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Account&#160;on Acquire</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\"><a href=\"/page/Armor_bonus\" title=\"Armor bonus\">Armor Bonus</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Maximum Dexterity Bonus\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\"><a href=\"/page/Armor_check_penalty\" title=\"Armor check penalty\">Armor Check Penalty</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\"><a href=\"/page/Arcane_spell_failure\" title=\"Arcane spell failure\">Arcane Spell Failure</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">Level dependent\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Material\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Cloth\" title=\"Cloth\">Cloth</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Cloth\" title=\"Cloth\">Cloth</a>:</b> <b>Cloth</b> is a very common material used in <a href=\"/page/Handwraps\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Handwraps\">handwraps</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Cloth_armor\" title=\"Category:Cloth armor\">robes, outfits</a>. and other <a href=\"/page/Accessories\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Accessories\">accessories</a>.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">Level dependent\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">None\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><b><a href=\"/page/Eveningstar_Challenge_Pack\" title=\"Eveningstar Challenge Pack\">Eveningstar Challenge Pack</a></b>, Turn in various Eveningstar Challenge Pack ingredients\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<ul><li>See: <a href=\"/page/Eveningstar_Challenge_Pack\" title=\"Eveningstar Challenge Pack\">Eveningstar Challenge Pack</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Cormyrean_Robes_(example).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Cormyrean_Robes_%28example%29.png/420px-Cormyrean_Robes_%28example%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"375\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Cormyrean_Robes_%28example%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>This robe, dyed in the purple of Cormyr's knights, is reinforced with metal plates. It has been enchanted by the War Wizards with magics to aid in spellcasting.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<ul><li>Minimum Levels available are 16, 20 and 24.</li>\n<li>Cormyrian / Cormyrean items spawn with random prefix in their name.</li>\n<li>The item description image shows one of many possible enchantment combinations.</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816200820\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.086 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1932/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 12340/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2613/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n163.11%  122.190     26 Template:IO\n100.00%   74.911      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   74.911      1 -total\n 94.43%   70.742      1 Template:Named_Armor\n 56.21%   42.110      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 55.24%   41.381      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 53.38%   39.986      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 52.09%   39.018      2 Template:InCategory\n 21.61%   16.188      1 Template:Mat\n 19.39%   14.526      1 Template:Popup\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:91050-0!canonical and timestamp 20260816200820 and revision id 692190. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
